🧠 Concept
Controls:

Who can talk to AKS
Which pods can communicate

🛠️ Hands-on Implementation
✅ Step 1: Private AKS Cluster
private_cluster_enabled = true

✅ Step 2: Restrict API Access
api_server_authorized_ip_ranges = ["YOUR_IP"]

✅ Step 3: Create Network Policy
Block all → allow only frontend → backend

apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: NetworkPolicy
metadata:
  name: allow-frontend
  namespace: default
spec:
  podSelector:
    matchLabels:
      app: backend
  ingress:
  - from:
    - podSelector:
        matchLabels:
          app: frontend


🚨 What You Achieved
✅ Zero-trust networking
✅ No lateral movement
